<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked fighters continue killing civilians in Ebola-hit eastern DR Congo, while ADF militants attacked the Cantine area in North Kivu, hampering the Ebola response and endangering health workers. The DR Congo army captured an alleged ADF intelligence officer and the Uganda People’s Defence Force rotated troops in the region as the ADF threat persists. Armed groups remain the main obstacle to controlling the outbreak and protecting civilians. The conflict still accounts for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBqQ01qb3lwNWhSR0VzZy1pZ2Rxa0VKNllXa0FOaGVJeWg5bnROUm9VaGZhODYwbnQ0Rl9VbXd3THBCMU5LR2tyQkVUWVl1cmFDZV8xckVvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1ZM3Z4SVhSd0VjV3UyQUFtb1V3NUhmVHNJWXo5eEZmLUdjVzQ1SkV6Zkl3SzlhclEtRUJmcEZmVFdJeFNxbXU5YXN2cEpjY1pocnNxLWhvWVkyRnJCdF9ZTXotdHVWS3lXX0lKMWNOME90VjRDSFpmaTNNclc0eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZG1waG1xOHJUdGpBcUdNUXNmSUJ6bUctdFFZMmw4OVhPUmdUTzdSMVJWOFJ1N1dLWDVVcVh6MDY5VlRmT2tZSFJIWFZrU1E2RmxtV1JRaDE0Q3dJcEVtMHUza3Z2d1Bla3FMcWZqeUgxRjBZQ1pEODhzUHVHZHA0aFBSZXdlWElQU1JxbVE3cEtYS01Nel9XbUNxbGwwYXVVQVlCUHA4YTIyS0RjVTVPMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPT2MyYUxGcWVoN0pmQVJnTXFGX2QxeWRSNXQ0MlBWaUZlZGVwOWRDY01aX3l4OC1HbEFHRkh0RkRGQWI1M0VqaE9TWXdzekZ2dE5Pbl9kSWZuMkE2WXRBSkhDendzajJua1FLQncxbnZ0OGw5MTN1SjVVMjA0cDdKMUVhbTJUUlhwRnB6WmstWVpRMXh2eFE?oc=5&quot;&